"description":"MAMA PAPA PRO is a personal virtual assistant for women.\n\nMAMA PAPA PRO together with the United Nations Population Fund (UNFPA) have developed a unique free birth preparation program \"We Are Expecting\", which you will find inside our mobile application.\n\nYou will receive answers to your questions regarding pregnancy, childbirth, child health, breastfeeding, psychology, and more.\n\nOur users love us because we help them navigate the planning and management of pregnancy, childbirth and childcare safely and comfortably.\n\nMoms and dads choose us because MAMA PAPA PRO content is developed by practitioners and experts based on evidence-based medicine, presented in three formats (video, text, podcasts) and is selected individually for each user, according to his interests and profile data.\n\nPregnancy, childbirth, mental health, healthy nutrition, breastfeeding, harmonious development of the child, hygiene and care - advice from experts is now always at hand!\n\nIn the MAMA PAPA PRO app you will find:\n- video courses and video tips for moms and dads;\n- articles from practicing doctors, psychologists and other specialists;\n- the program of preparation for childbirth \"We are Expecting a Baby\";\n- daily useful tips and suggestions - \"Chip of the day\";\n- expert content for women's and children's health.\n\nAll materials are submitted individually, adjusting to your gestational age and the age of the child. The most important things are collected here, which allows you to save your time. Your virtual assistant MAMA PAPA PRO will pick up all the necessary information.\n\nOnly the necessary and verified information about pregnancy and the health of the child. Practicing obstetricians-gynecologists, pediatricians, psychologists, dermatologists, orthopedists, dentists and other professionals worked on the creation of the application.\n\nPersonal recommendations, convenient information search and answers to the most popular questions. Everything that moms and dads want to know about pregnancy, childbirth and child health is in one application.\n\nUseful and interesting content not only for mothers, but also for fathers. Thanks to relevant and convenient formats for submitting materials, dads will be able to learn a lot of valuable information about the health and development of their baby.\n\nInstall the MAMA PAPA PRO mobile application right now and get access to unique content from experienced doctors and experts in their field.", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":5, "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/mama-pro-papa-pro-pregnancy/id6449796254?uo=4", "sellerUrl":"https://mamapro.health/", "trackCensoredName":"MAMA PRO PAPA PRO Pregnancy", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN", "RU"], "fileSizeBytes":"38168576", "formattedPrice":"Free", "contentAdvisoryRating":"12+", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":2, "trackContentRating":"12+", "averageUserRating":5, "bundleId":"health.mamapro.mproapp", "userRatingCount":2}, 
