"description":"Health Optimizer™ gives you personalized tips, nutrition help, and a 24/7 AI assistant, all in one secure app built to make living with your health condition easier. \n\nFeatures include:\n\n•\t24/7 AI Health Assistant: Meet your built-in assistant ready around the clock to answer questions, guide you through the app, and help keep your health journey on track.\n•\tGet Personalized Support: Access expert condition support and secure 1:1 chat with your dedicated care team whenever you need extra help.\n•\tInstant, Tailored Feedback: Receive actionable tips and guidance the moment you log readings like blood glucose and weight.\n•\tSimplify Eating and Nutrition: Make food choices effortless with AI-powered nutrition insights, meal planning tools, healthy recipes, grocery list support, and menu guidance for eating out. \n•\tSync Devices for Deeper Insights: Sync your weight, activity, and other health data through devices, such as Apple Health®, to bring all your data together for a clearer picture of your overall wellness.\n•\tExplore Day-to-Day Tools: Elevate your daily routine with fitness and meditation videos, trusted condition resources, and interactive goals and challenges.\n•\tTrack Readings and Trends in One Place: Keep all your health logs, lab entries, and vital metrics organized in a central hub with clear long-term trend graphs.\n\nHealth Optimizer is not intended to replace the care provided by a licensed healthcare professional, including prescriptions, diagnosis, or treatment. Seek the guidance of a licensed healthcare professional before making medical decisions.\n\nThe privacy and security of your personal information is very important to us. We protect it in accordance with the Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act (HIPAA).\n\nManufactured by Welldoc, Inc. Distributed by CVS Pharmacy, Inc. and/or one of its affiliates. Health Optimizer is intended for visitors from the United States.\n\n©2026 CVS Health and/or one of its 