"description":"Health Monitoring, Simplified.\nOakWell is a risk-focused health guard for people who care about daily health stability rather than a strong body. It uses Apple Watch data to turn complex signals into calm, easy-to-understand summaries — so users and families can see what deserves attention today.\nWhy OakWell is different from general health monitoring apps：\n- Effortless Visibility: Large typography, high-contrast dark mode, and simplified layouts tailored for aging eyes.\n- What to focus on today: You don't need to check every number. OakWell intelligently highlights only the metrics that need your immediate attention\n- Trend-first insights: 14-day trend views that help spot gradual changes over time, not just single readings.\n- Health Timeline: A unique way to review history. Each day shows a daily status summary and the top 3 metrics to watch. Tap any date to see a \"Key Moments\" replay—understanding exactly when your health metrics changed during the day.\nKey features\n- Continuous Apple Watch-based monitoring\n- 14-day trend charts across key signals\n- Simplified statuses instead of overwhelming raw numbers\n- No social feeds, no gamification, no distractions\nNote: OakWell relies on Apple Watch data. It is for informational purposes only and is not a medical device. It does not provide medical advice or diagnosis.\nLearn More:\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.coreloop.pro/privacy-policy\nTerms of Use: https://www.coreloop.pro/terms-of-use\nAny Questions? You can send an email to oakwell@coreloop.pro", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.5988100000000002864908310584723949432373046875, "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/oakwell-health-guard/id6756409879?uo=4", "sellerUrl":"http://coreloop.pro", "trackCensoredName":"OakWell: Health Guard", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN", "ZH"], "fileSizeBytes":"128348160", "formattedPrice":"Free", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":3684, "trackContentRating":"4+", "average